{
  "id": "1JN.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "1JN",
  "reference": "1 Yohana 4",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1JN 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Roho waNyasaye, naroho womufukuli waKristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaheelwa banje, murasuubila buli roho ta; ne muteeme abaroho, nibaba nibali baNyasaye nohomba; shichila abanabii bobubeeyi abanji barulile nibasalaana khushialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwikhuwa lino mumanye Roho waNyasaye; mbu buli roho owiyama shinga Yesu Kristo olwa wamala okhwitsa mumubili, arula khuNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa buli roho oureeyama Yesu, shiyarula khuNyasaye tawe; ne niye roho womufukuli waKristo, owa mwahulilakhwo mbu ali okhwitsa; ne kata bulaano aliho mushialo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe mwarula khuNyasaye, rwana rwanje; ne mwabahula; shichila ouli mwinywe ashila oyo ouli mushialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bo bali abeshialo; niko akachila nibaboola akeshialo, eshialo nashio nishibahulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifwe khuli baNyasaye; oumanyile Nyasaye akhuhulilanga; ne ourali owaNyasaye shiakhuhulilanga tawe. Khukano khumanyile okhwahukhasia roho wobwatoto nende roho wobukorwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye niye obuheeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaheelwe banje, khuheelanenje; shichila obuheeli burula khuNyasaye; buli mundu yesi ouheelanga yeebulwa nende Nyasaye, khandi wamanya Nyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouraheelanga shiyamumanya Nyasaye ta; okhuba Nyasaye nobuheeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulino nimwo omwa obuheeli bwaNyasaye bwalolosilibwa mwifwe, mbu Nyasaye waruma Omwanawe omuteelwa mushialo, mbu ifwe khube mwoyo khululwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulino nimwo omwa obuheeli buli; shilili mbu ifwe khwamuheela Nyasaye ta, habula mbu ye yakhuheela ifwe, naruma Omwanawe abe eshitiso shiebionoono bieefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaheelwa banje, olwa Nyasaye yakhuheela ifwe ario, neefu khukhoyile okhuheelananga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulaho owamulolakhwo Nyasaye tawe; ne nikhuba nikhuheelananga, Nyasaye aba namenyanga mwifwe, obuheelibwe nabwo nibukholwa obulamba mwifwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwikhuwa lino nimwo omwa khumanyiile shinga olwa khumenyanga muye, naye mwifwe, mbu shichila yakhukabiilekhwo khuRohowe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neefu khwalola nikhurumbula akobuloli khwikhuwa lino, mbu Samwana yaruma Omwana okhuba Omuhonia weshialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi owiyama shinga Yesu olwa ali Omwana waNyasaye, Nyasaye amenyanga muye, naye muNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neefu khumanyile khandi khusuubiliile obuheeli obwa Nyasaye ali ninabwo khwifwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye niye obuheeli; ne oumenyanga mubuheeli amenyanga muNyasaye, naye Nyasaye amenyanga muye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwikhuwa lino nimwo omwa obuheeli bukholelwamwo obulamba mwifwe, mbu khube abeikholo nyumu khunyanga yeshiina, shichila shinga ye olwa ali, nindio ifwe khuli mushialo shino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuheeli shibulimwo oburii bwosi ta; nebutswa obuheeli obulamba bwilusinjia oburii, okhuba oburii bulimwo obukuumwi; ne ouriitsanga shiakholwa omulamba mubuheeli ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifwe khuheelanga, shichila ye yaranjilila okhukhuheela ifwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu naba naboola ari Emuheelanga Nyasaye, ne nakiya omwana wabwe, nomubeeyi; shichila ouraheela omwana wabwe, owa alolanga, shikakhanyalikha mbu amuheela Nyasaye owa aralolakhwo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilako lino khuli ninalio okhurula khuye, mbu ouheela Nyasaye aheele nende omwana wabwe yesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
